---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Layout title="页面未找到"><section class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">404</p><h1>这个页面暂时找不到。</h1><p>链接可能已经变更。你可以返回习语目录，或从语言开始探索。</p><div class="actions"><a class="button-link" href={`${base}/`}>浏览习语</a><a class="button-link" href={`${base}/languages/`}>浏览语言</a></div></section></Layout>
